{"id":28075,"slug":"la-vie-de-jesus","title":"La vie de Jésus","year":1997,"country":"France","duration":96,"spine":980,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28075-la-vie-de-jesus","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/3f701abce3056ac0a8b08dffcc53d24c/GWIBIOQgKgUGxxpdojBgVS33vpTO6B_large.jpg","description":"\nWith his stunning debut feature, the risk-taking auteur Bruno Dumont immediately established his reputation as an uncompromising iconoclast on the cutting edge of French cinema. Blending unflinching realism with moments of startling, light-filled beauty, La vie de Jésus finds unexpected philosophical richness in the quotidian, small-town existence of Freddy (nonprofessional David Douche in a revelatory, one-off performance), an aimless young man with epilepsy who, in his childlike simplicity, embodies both great tenderness and terrifying brutality. Leaving the film’s cryptic title tantalizingly open to interpretation, Dumont dares viewers to see the divine in a seemingly dead-end world.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"}],"cast":[{"actor":"David Douche","role":"Freddy","slug":"david-douche"},{"actor":"Marjorie Cottreel","role":"Marie","slug":"marjorie-cottreel"},{"actor":"Geneviève Cottreel","role":"Yvette","slug":"genevieve-cottreel"},{"actor":"Kader Chaatouf","role":"Kader","slug":"kader-chaatouf"},{"actor":"Sébastien Delbaere","role":"Gégé","slug":"sebastien-delbaere"},{"actor":"Sébastien Bailleul","role":"Quinquin","slug":"sebastien-bailleul"},{"actor":"Samuel Boidin","role":"Michou","slug":"samuel-boidin"},{"actor":"Steve Smagghe","role":"Robert","slug":"steve-smagghe"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Bruno Dumont","slug":"bruno-dumont"},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Jean Bréhat","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Rachid Bouchareb","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Muriel M